# Input
```css
/* should not generate diagnostics */

/* Nesting selectors with the same authored tail can resolve to different target compounds. */
.card {
  .column {
    :root[data-theme="dark"] & {}
  }

  code {
    :root[data-theme="dark"] & {}
  }
}

/* Parent selector lists expand one nested selector into several resolved selectors. */
.settings button {
  #theme &:hover {}
}

.settings select,
.settings .trigger,
.editor select {
  &:hover {}
}

.files li.active {
  #theme & {}
}

.settings select,
.settings .trigger,
.editor select {
  #theme & {}
}

```
